== mcp tests, this repository's gateway (no patch 0005)
ok 1 - reads: the village, the owner's storehouse (not a stranger's), the shortfall and where to fill it
ok 2 - reads never show another player's march: the Province envelope's ArrivalSlots stay out of every answer
ok 3 - prepare: only the owner's places; the cargo against the source; a plan sends nothing
ok 4 - without patch 0005 the relay refuses the caravan (ActionNotAllowed): nothing is sent, the owner is told why
ok 5 - the whole play: send → accepted → processing (landed, on the road) → completed (delivered); sending is not arriving # SKIP needs patch 0005 in the gateway tree (WS03_GATEWAY_ROOT)
ok 6 - raids and lost destinations are outcomes, not server failures: taken, burned, lost # SKIP needs patch 0005 in the gateway tree (WS03_GATEWAY_ROOT)
ok 7 - a failed transaction on chain is failed (nothing moved), with the program's reason # SKIP needs patch 0005 in the gateway tree (WS03_GATEWAY_ROOT)
ok 8 - duplicates: the same requestId (again, concurrently) sends once; a new requestId on a used plan is PlanUsed; a used requestId on another plan conflicts # SKIP needs patch 0005 in the gateway tree (WS03_GATEWAY_ROOT)
ok 9 - a lost connection to the relay: requested and retryable; the retry with the same requestId sends once # SKIP needs patch 0005 in the gateway tree (WS03_GATEWAY_ROOT)
ok 10 - the relay answered but the MCP reply was lost: the gateway replays its record; a restarted server finds the operation and follows it to the end # SKIP needs patch 0005 in the gateway tree (WS03_GATEWAY_ROOT)
ok 11 - the owner's signed limits (MOCK grant): sends, cargo per send, expiry — enforced by the server # SKIP needs patch 0005 in the gateway tree (WS03_GATEWAY_ROOT)
ok 12 - ⑤'s budget decides, not this server: a priced action over the agent's budget is BudgetExceeded, nothing sent # SKIP needs patch 0005 in the gateway tree (WS03_GATEWAY_ROOT)
ok 13 - the owner's controls on the agent hold: stopped (manual), the delegation taken back on chain, the capability rotated # SKIP needs patch 0005 in the gateway tree (WS03_GATEWAY_ROOT)
ok 14 - another player's village: refused by this server (a tampered plan is stale) and, under it, by the gateway (WrongVillage) # SKIP needs patch 0005 in the gateway tree (WS03_GATEWAY_ROOT)
ok 15 - words in the game are data: an injected order in the agent's history is marked untrusted and changes nothing
ok 16 - secrets: the capability never appears in an answer, a log or the store file; tokens are stored as hashes # SKIP needs patch 0005 in the gateway tree (WS03_GATEWAY_ROOT)
ok 17 - consent: a caravan scope without the owner's signed rotate command is refused
ok 18 - discovery: protected resource and authorization server metadata name this resource, S256 only, DCR
ok 19 - /mcp without a token: 401 with WWW-Authenticate naming the resource metadata; GET is 405; a foreign Origin is 403; no batches
ok 20 - initialize negotiates a supported version; tools/list: one operation per tool, every annotation explicit, OAuth schemes
ok 21 - OAuth: PKCE, code reuse, resource, redirect URIs, and a refresh token used twice revokes the connection
ok 22 - consent: a statement signed by another key, an agent this relay does not know; the page holds no secret
ok 23 - consent: an agent that belongs to another owner on the same relay is refused
ok 24 - tokens expire; the owner's signed revocation stops the connection; a read-only connection cannot send (insufficient_scope)
ok 25 - the official MCP SDK client: OAuth discovery, DCR, PKCE, then tools/list and the read path
